        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The table below illustrates weekly consumption by age group of  dairy products in a European country.  Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KPFed9EfnoYzq0xL5t1lQA01gfh\"><em><strong>The table below illustrates weekly consumption by age group of dairy products in a European country. </strong><strong> </strong><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Dairy Consumption by Age Group</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) </span></em><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/ZcEW9dXmJVk?si=-5ivOFUE68mHZEDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</span></a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/ZcEW9dXmJVk?si=-5ivOFUE68mHZEDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;</a></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Dairy Consumption by Age Group y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả mức ti&ecirc;u thụ c&aacute;c phẩm từ sữa h&agrave;ng tuần theo nh&oacute;m tuổi ở một nước ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span>&nbsp;trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\">Paraphrase đề Dairy Consumption by Age Group với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: mức ti&ecirc;u thụ sản phẩm từ sữa h&agrave;ng tuần - 4 nh&oacute;m tuổi - một nước ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2HQdOfU8on4s1x23khlRcEhgN9\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Người cao tuổi uống nhiều sữa nhất, c&ograve;n nh&oacute;m trung ni&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u thụ nhiều bơ nhất.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BpQgdHyp7oHe7gxjbsxlqVxyglg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đa số c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m tuổi đều th&iacute;ch sản phẩm &iacute;t b&eacute;o cho cả sữa v&agrave; bơ, trừ nh&oacute;m dưới 25 tuổi.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong> <strong>Ti&ecirc;u thụ sữa</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VQBUdYwttor5zRxQesYlb1YCgYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m dưới 25 tuổi</strong> <em>(1200 ml mỗi tuần | 59% full fat | c&ograve;n lại l&agrave; low fat)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QHgXdftcvoJ6tYxRAY9lR08rgJb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m 26-45</strong> <em>(1650 ml | 80% l&agrave; low fat, 20% l&agrave; full fat).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPfHdFnnFoHJl6xkK2Clbp2Qg7g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m 45-64 </strong><em>(1670 ml | 55% l&agrave; low fat, 45% l&agrave; full fat).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2Wzd2XnroO7VzxzULclVeKpg1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả nh&oacute;m 65+ </strong><em>(1900 ml | 70% l&agrave; low fat, 30% l&agrave; full fat).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ejc6dy9xgoCTiZxU3D0ll8ggg4J\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong> <strong>Ti&ecirc;u thụ bơ</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RW7HdQZzIovwUNxdtOflwx6agPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh nh&oacute;m dưới 25 tuổi</strong><em> (th&iacute;ch full-fat hơn, 60% trong 12g l&agrave; full-fat v&agrave; 40% l&agrave; low fat)</em> v&agrave; <strong>nh&oacute;m 26-45 </strong><em>(ngược lại, 38% trong 19g l&agrave; full fat v&agrave; 60% l&agrave; low fat)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LV8adaZqQoKHozxYthWlqSLYgkm\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh hai nh&oacute;m c&ograve;n lại:</strong> <em>(nh&oacute;m 45-64 (60g)<strong> gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong> nh&oacute;m 65+ (30g)<strong> </strong>- lượng full v&agrave; low-fat trong bơ tương tự nhau)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u tả trend sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"213;305;423\"><colgroup><col width=\"213\"><col width=\"305\"><col width=\"423\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GKj9d9l6AobrC4xL35sl3ggvgid\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GI9ZdyAYio3fpTxKXCIlRI58gDf\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvfydUXkJoN2atxyK3tljJMIguh\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EBLFdOr2hovWWRxI03RlBuEGg1q\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu cho th&ocirc;ng tin đ&atilde; được nhắc trước đ&oacute; với \"WHICH\"</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JeLDdM7c6oy8SWxdRHFlXhQdgPc\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D7KpdSJiFo5HUxxP1szlb0hsgRb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>S-FV, number + of which + V</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JMh1dUTtZoNyzsxBvDNlb5lIghd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KD27dnaFCoh2b4xDY0QlPbRbg7R\">People under 25 drink the least milk, at 1200ml per week, 59% <strong>of which</strong> is full fat.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLK1dQBkAopI6IxRqt4lTQHygre\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WO4ldT5reoKQUvx3RhGlzDXMg1b\">1900ml is drunk per week by the elderly, <strong>only 30% of which</strong> is full fat, while the remaining 70% is low fat.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FhxgdvkX3o133fx44jylsYUUgFh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YAc9d4KeporSRXx0yVUlASQFgCb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu gấp đ&ocirc;i/ gấp ba</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ApZXdSC3god9VUxbYVglOimbg9b\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>be double/ triple + NOUN</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIZvdDr23oEjKPxe3dElMxhJggg\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0dTd7SEHoGDGgxCccblxpp9gpd\">The amount of butter consumed by the second oldest age group <strong>is double</strong> that of the oldest one, at 60g and 30g respectively</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HFLGdAtouoXt5exinX9lLt9EgIb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c với từ With để bổ sung th&ecirc;m th&ocirc;ng tin</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZLxdlcrboEn9hxvA3FlQBtcgSc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>S-FV, with + N + VING</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KCqTd4zYPoVw9Rx7W6jlmGqjgCc\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uqp1dGu1FotTf0x6X8WlCwalgKj\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The amount of butter consumed by the second oldest age group is double that of the oldest one, at 60g and 30g respectively, <strong>with both groups consuming nearly equal amounts of full and low-fat butter.</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 229,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SQvodTiegopCWGxMKTulv8Xqgnb\">The given table contains information about weekly dairy consumption of four age groups, namely below 25, 26 to 44, 45 to 64, and over 65, in a European nation.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13660,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 230,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CV2Idv0okohpSnxritKlI153gPh\">Overall, it is clear that people of their retirement age drink the most milk, while those in the second oldest group eat by far the most butter. In addition, people across all age demographics prefer the low-fat alternative for both products, with the exception of the youngest group.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13660,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 231,
